<title>USA: Atrix names Dean Gerber CFO. [CORRECTED 23:07 GMT]</title>
<headline>Atrix names Dean Gerber CFO. [CORRECTED 23:07 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atrix International said Wednesday it named Dean Gerber chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Gerber, who had been controller for the remote metering products maker, will assume the chief financial officer title from president and chief executive officer Steven Riedel, Riedel said.</p>
<p>Atrix shares were down 1/32 at at 17/32 Wednesday. (Corrects share price)</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
